							<p class="mt-8 text-pretty text-lg font-normal text-gray-900 sm:text-xl/8">Buzbo is a new way to connect ambitious professionals with  companies that hire for mindset, passion and character —  not just experience. The app isn't live yet. The waitlist is  how you get in first.</p>
							<div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-x-6">
								<a href="#" class="font-semibold bg-primary-crimson py-2 px-7 rounded-full text-white text-lg ">Join the waitlist</a>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="mt-16 flex flex-1 items-center justify-center sm:mt-24 lg:mt-0 lg:justify-end">
							<img
								src="/hero.png"
								width="595"
								height="548"
								alt="Buzbo team network showing people connected across departments"
								class="w-full max-w-sm sm:max-w-md lg:max-w-lg xl:max-w-xl drop-shadow-2xl"
								loading="eager"
							/>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="bg-primary-beige">
