									<div class="max-w-xl">
										<p class="mt-6">Every day, more professionals and companies join the Buzbo  waitlist. Not because we told them to, but because they're  done with hiring that ignores who people actually are. Join now, and you're part of the first wave — before the  app even exists.</p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="mt-10 flex">
